        <item>
            <title>3.23.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:55:33 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>226</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.23.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.23.0</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>New</strong></p><ul><li>Find duplicate files in AI Rename: turn on Detect duplicate files in a template's settings, then keep the copies as they are, mark them in the name or move them to the Trash. Copies don't use credits.</li><li>The new Remove Duplicates template moves exact copies to the Trash and leaves file names unchanged.</li><li>Copies moved to the Trash are listed in Activity, and Undo puts them back.</li><li>Buying PRO opens checkout in your browser, where you can pay with Apple Pay or Google Pay.</li></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>A redesigned welcome window explains that nothing changes before you click Rename, how undo works, how your files are used and where to find offline AI.</li><li>The Custom AI Blocks group in Naming Blocks can be collapsed, and templates have new icons.</li><li>Quick Rename handles large Finder selections more reliably, and more EPUB books can be read.</li></ul><p><strong>Fixed</strong></p><ul><li>Silent or damaged audio files are named from their details instead of failing.</li><li>Checkout no longer reports an error for a typo you can fix in the payment form.</li></ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://zushapp.com/releases/Zush-3.23.0.dmg" length="19703043" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="zFrgPEd9lwY03UuOAz9wvArbDNQkFhCZTRvYsgZvqmuhg0UR8IxPGnJsse90KIwpivc7R3N2dn8ANcWBxOOxCg=="/>
